      "width": 1628,
      "height": 1056,
      "caption": "The discrete dyadic rest-density fractions follow the analytic scale-covariant mass envelope.  The dominant mass is many orders of magnitude above the vacuum scale in the calibrated benchmark."
    },
    {
      "source": "monographs/physics/source/cosmology/figures/scw/weighted_locking_and_release.png",
      "source_sha256": "174056395510cb3abb2335211e2ec70732fc85216bd515e55d01eb13e380cef4",
      "image": "assets/figures/physics-cosmology/weighted_locking_and_release.png",
