      "width": 1628,
      "height": 1056,
      "caption": "The weighted detail density stabilizes the average mode well before acceleration begins.  Dilution eventually removes the locking curvature and releases the vacuum mode."
    },
    {
      "source": "monographs/physics/source/cosmology/figures/scw/weighted_transfer_suppression.png",
      "source_sha256": "7e2ed284e3ea5169dbfa329e46dfda5911d4d0686272326f0184cda2443959a5",
      "image": "assets/figures/physics-cosmology/weighted_transfer_suppression.png",
