      "width": 1628,
      "height": 1056,
      "caption": "The production epoch controls the free-streaming cutoff without changing the late locking law.  The high-$k$ oscillations are those of the finite sound-speed fluid closure."
    },
    {
      "source": "monographs/physics/source/cosmology/figures/cb/collisionless_vs_fluid_transfer.png",
      "source_sha256": "a2e6237f43e13ea27bd89e0821b5c9f4eb60af1f21c598ba1e9c49d7df34278d",
